  "content": "<p>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/junyudev/sophisticated-ping/raw/1.19.2/common/src/main/resources/assets/sophisticated_ping/icon.png\" width=\"200\"> \n</p><h1>精密標記</h1><p>Minecraft 的精密標記輪盤。讓 MC 重返巔峰！</p><h2>標記系統</h2><p>預設快捷鍵：<code>c</code></p><p>向隊伍發送訊號以進行溝通。</p><p>在標記點上再次按下快捷鍵可取消標記。</p><h2>圖片</h2><p>來自隊友的標記：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/junyudev/sophisticated-ping/raw/1.19.2/images/pingFromTeammate.png\" alt=\"pingFromTeammate\"></p><p>夜晚的標記：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/junyudev/sophisticated-ping/raw/1.19.2/images/pingAtNight.png\" alt=\"pingAtNight\"></p>",
